  "body": "Stacked on #3401. That PR uses the locked Passes row from #3387, which follows #3353. The GitHub base is the upstream branch of #3353. Commit `4ab08d8ea` contains only the Trochoidal Slot change.\n\nTrochoidal Slot shows a disabled Auto control and explains the loop order. The tool starts at the entry bore. Each new loop advances along the slot and uses clearance from the preceding cut. The MCP add and edit commands give the same reason when a caller supplies `pass_start`. A saved Trochoidal Slot keeps its existing format.\n\nFor a straight slot, the entry bore is at the start of the chain. At one cutting depth, the next loop centers advance by one accepted spacing along the chain. The microlift retraces the arc that was just cut. The next front then advances into new material. Reordering these fronts would change the stock under the return and entry moves.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n**Face Passes before** (`59b42c727`)\n\n![Face Passes before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/3e33945956469e910910a8aae9863572fe8b5a7d/3422/3422-stack-face-before.png)\n\n**Face Passes after** (`4ab08d8ea`)\n\n![Face Passes after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/3e33945956469e910910a8aae9863572fe8b5a7d/3422/3422-stack-face-after.png)\n\n**Slot Passes before** (`59b42c727`)\n\n![Slot Passes before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/3e33945956469e910910a8aae9863572fe8b5a7d/3422/3422-stack-slot-before.png)\n\n**Slot Passes after** (`4ab08d8ea`)\n\n![Slot Passes after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/3e33945956469e910910a8aae9863572fe8b5a7d/3422/3422-stack-slot-after.png)\n\n**Trochoidal Slot Passes before** (`59b42c727`)\n\n![Trochoidal Slot Passes before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/3e33945956469e910910a8aae9863572fe8b5a7d/3422/3422-stack-trochoidal-slot-before.png)\n\n**Trochoidal Slot Passes after** (`4ab08d8ea`)\n\n![Trochoidal Slot Passes after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/3e33945956469e910910a8aae9863572fe8b5a7d/3422/3422-trochoidal-slot-after.png)\n\n## Verification\n\n- `trochoidal_slot_refuses_pass_start_on_add_and_edit_without_mutation` and `the_trochoidal_slot_passes_tab_locks_auto_and_explains_the_loop_order` both failed on the Slot parent, `3572ca334`. MCP returned a generic unknown-field error, and the Passes tab had no row. Both tests pass on this head. The MCP test covers `auto`, `inside`, `outside`, and `null` on add and edit, and checks the saved job and undo history.\n- All five operation tests and 12 motion tests passed. They check the floor arcs across three sections of the slot, the saved project, microlift returns on cleared material, and the clearance-plane limit.\n- The generated small-slot CL, the DXF-based slot CL, and the Fanuc NC output each matched their committed golden files byte for byte. All 22 focused tests passed.\n- Clippy passed for all targets in `camcraft-app` and `camcraft-ui` with warnings denied. The touched-binary gate passed 361 app tests and 1,513 UI tests. The UI library also reported seven ignored tests. The full quick plan against the immediate parent selected 323 steps. One shared re-export selected 309 app suites. The scoped gate executed 24 planned steps and a scoped app prebuild. The aggregate app prebuild and 298 unrelated app executions were deferred. Against the immediate parent `3572ca334`, all 204 selected release-mode execution steps completed. They recorded 46 passing tests and the two registered expected failures (#1950 and #2849). Of the 204 steps, 181 had no ignored cases to run. Each selected suite compiled on demand. The separate aggregate compile-only step was omitted.\n\nThe motion generator is unchanged. This change uses the no-order case specified in #3358. No physical machine run was performed.\n\nThe release checks on a separate trial merge with upstream `main` are in progress.\n\nChangelog: The Trochoidal Slot Passes tab and MCP explain why the tool must follow the existing loop order.\n\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #3358\n",
